.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-rio-idol-00","Text":"さあ、今日も頑張りましょう。"},{"Id":"login_bonus_text-default-rui","__unknown":[],"__msg":"Solis.Common.Proto.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-rui-idol-00","Text":"いつも通り全力で頑張りますよ。"},{"Id":"login_bonus_text-default-ski","__unknown":[],"__msg":"Solis.Common.Proto.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-ski-idol-00","Text":"日々の積み重ねが大事ですね。"},{"Id":"login_bonus_text-default-skr","__unknown":[],"__msg":"Solis.Common.Proto.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-skr-idol-00","Text":"張り切ってやりますよー！"},{"Id":"login_bonus_text-default-smr","__unknown":[],"__msg":"Solis.Common.Proto.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-smr-idol-00","Text":"昨日よりもっと頑張りまーす！"},{"Id":"login_bonus_text-default-suz","__unknown":[],"__msg":"Solis.Common.Proto.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-suz-idol-00","Text":"がんばりますわよ！"},{"Id":"login_bonus_text-default-szk","__unknown":[],"__msg":"Solis.Common.Proto.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-szk-idol-00","Text":"今日も……頑張る。"},{"Id":"login_bonus_text-default-yu","__unknown":[],"__msg":"Solis.Common.Proto.Master.LoginBonusText","CostumeId":"cos-yu-idol-00","Text":"あ、今日も一緒に過ごせるんやね。嬉しいなぁ。"}]
